# UNDERDELVE: the run is saved when leaving, and CONTINUE restores it (a
# cartridge with a delve in progress asks first; a fresh one boots straight
# into the mine).
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 1 2 150 130
cheat money 123
cheat give 1
wait 5
expect has_save == 1
reload
game underdelve
wait 10
press A
wait 10
expect state == 1
expect money == 123
expect room_x == 1
expect room_y == 2
expect items & 1
